{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y压缩叙述后，少数关键心理因果不如X交代完整，尤其是他为什么要用受过的气压住想念，以及早知道会孤单是否还会离开。 \",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的重点句有明确视觉抓手，话语和感受交替出现，感受又能跟随音乐节点进入，观众更容易在听音乐时抓住每段发生了什么、情绪怎样变化。它对音乐中的具体动作、音色、节奏、情绪转折描写得更细，也通过反复出现的亲近、孤单、受委屈和向前走形成了更鲜明的整体呼应。X的优势是心理因果解释更充分，但整体而言，Y更容易让普通观众既跟上故事，又听见音乐里的细微变化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "17208eb0-4c3a-4b70-b17a-330f1a47a425", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T212427806718Z", "elapsed_seconds": 38.844, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T21:25:06.674049+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "82002aec56a5b9bf7d037a706959812203b41f499671a855f332a2264b2905e8", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_a